    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67e658a3000000001c003f7d:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-10:u2",
      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "然后直接先做一道算法题\n求将n（2≤n≤53）拆成k（k≥2，k可以是任意值）个正整数后k个正整数乘积的最大值\n动态规划秒了",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67e658a3000000001c003f7d.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "39f0c2a6c56b8693ce450534d176a6afb5dcf5a71b0dfb1a498285e862eaacb4",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67e658a3000000001c003f7d.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "e3728b17fff8e8095c88205d3e491d4f66917f71df8735f11552bad60aba4618",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67e658a3000000001c003f7d:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-10:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "做项目的时候最难的问题（新技术的学习到使用）\n单体架构相对于微服务架构有优点吗\n介绍一下MySQL有哪些锁",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67e658a3000000001c003f7d.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "39f0c2a6c56b8693ce450534d176a6afb5dcf5a71b0dfb1a498285e862eaacb4",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67e658a3000000001c003f7d.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "e3728b17fff8e8095c88205d3e491d4f66917f71df8735f11552bad60aba4618",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67e658a3000000001c003f7d:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-10:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "然后又做了一道题，单例模式\nvolatile和sycronized做出来了，让介绍一下volatile和sycronized的底层原理（问的很深，这个记不太清了答得一般般）",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67e658a3000000001c003f7d.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "39f0c2a6c56b8693ce450534d176a6afb5dcf5a71b0dfb1a498285e862eaacb4",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67e658a3000000001c003f7d.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "e3728b17fff8e8095c88205d3e491d4f66917f71df8735f11552bad60aba4618",
        "source_projection_item_number": 4
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67e658a3000000001c003f7d:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-10:u5",
      "position": 5,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "垃圾回收器都了解哪些（serial，parnew，g1，cms），但是他问了我另一个z开头（这个没咋看），我说不太了解，就没问了\n然后问我垃圾回收这一块主要是在哪里看的（答的开源社区加b站等视频平台）",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67e658a3000000001c003f7d.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "39f0c2a6c56b8693ce450534d176a6afb5dcf5a71b0dfb1a498285e862eaacb4",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67e658a3000000001c003f7d.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
